#: scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f07bf44dded142298faa11569f983679473730b7f41afd26065c5aa60f68c79
#. default-sha256: daf6bd852c0acc513dd220b78c783076ae0f0938ba014be7086efa89b759ee11
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am, even now, putting her through a harrowing experience.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Digging up the memories "
"she locked away,⟪k:3⟫the past she wanted to pretend never happened,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫直到现在，⟪k:1⟫我依旧对她做着无比残酷之事。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫让那些，⟪k:4⟫她极力想要否定的过去……⟪k:5⟫"
"以及不愿回忆的往事——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 666fda13702d4537b2b73d881f1f7b536920deab63cf52b8e276e7da032e25db
#. default-sha256: d962aefa8608045e4cae09be1c711137aa37fe34505bb648d4b378e6978fa067
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ get her back to who she once was... ⟪k:3⟫even if means forcing her to "
"endure this."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是……⟪k:1⟫即便如此……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我也必须，⟪k:4⟫让她找回自我。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8572E743_F1B9_4725_83AC_301F6C7F53F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a8cdc0dc97b5323349099ae1f840c807563715676b74c31252a0e4f70c5b415
