msgid "⟪k:0⟫She ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ remember everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫同时，必须找回我所有的记忆。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BE807F3_EF9C_4755_8CDA_4DB5B59BF213
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b3d7da0722b93361e3164dbdc58668496cee439a2b79ece8ce81130be54e250
