msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……但是，⟪k:1⟫还不能就此结束。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_433AD9C5_8D01_4816_9DFA_2A7298F26081
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
