msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Perfect darkness embraces us once more.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can see nothing—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"not even the woman beside me—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫即使，⟪k:4⟫真正的黑暗再次覆盖着我们，⟪k:5⟫眼前什么都看不清。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A6033E7A_86D1_4124_8A68_8D00A54D929B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fc439c863b481d38e5c87b19a15483fce18d31654b510273dd02175158ee9a8
