msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C060641D_4200_474C_9BD0_D89E2D008FCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You had me scared silly there.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I thought I might’ve lost you for good.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’m "
"really glad you’re alive."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我以为你再也醒不来了呢，⟪k:1⟫真的是吓得我冷汗直流……⟪k:2⟫总之，⟪k:3⟫你还活着实在是太好了。"

