#: scenario5:scenario5_C3DB361C_B880_438D_ACA4_44DBCD43D550
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1e11ccd6967c633f5ea74be5ee492afc72d06fe8b0e98fbb2bfc8c0c129d9ce
