msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Giselle’s shadow, which had been lurking in the halls for about a month, was nowhere to be "
"found. ⟪k:1⟫She hadn’t come back since running off that day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫曾留在馆内一个月之久，⟪k:1⟫名叫吉赛儿的女子的气息，⟪k:2⟫已经全然感觉不到了。⟪k:3⟫那晚，她从馆"
