"⟪k:0⟫Ahh... ⟪k:1⟫n-⟪k:2⟫no, that’s just fine!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’ll do my best to get along with everyone!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫啊……⟪k:1⟫没、⟪k:2⟫没关系的！⟪k:3⟫我也、⟪k:4⟫想要努力和大家好好相处。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_83AFB7F6_4A7B_4F66_93BB_FDBF7A099542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90431bac5a204c764873349b75ef67d0806730cd8a3e4225201ae1be37a480a5
