msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Haha. You’ve got a spark in you that wasn’t there yesterday.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Anything in particular "
"that cheered you up?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫哈哈……⟪k:1⟫你和昨天完全不一样了，⟪k:2⟫整个人都变得相当开朗。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫是心境产生了变化吗？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B63ABCFF_2F09_459A_80FD_4E04BA829F16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccd8c83a6de780a7280c1d0a78f4a8739bad0359953d1e32fa0607a7dc4a0d91
