msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6B395FC1_F244_4E44_92D9_73CEB67F8ED8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Keep thanking me like that and my cheeks might get stuck red.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...In any event. I "
"said I’d show you around yesterday,⟪k:3⟫so how about we do that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫被你这么感谢的话，⟪k:1⟫总觉得心里有点刺痒痒的。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……接下来，⟪k:4⟫就像昨天说的那样，带"
"你参观一下村子。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2E7F490_BA4E_4388_A083_E16CDDD4F1A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ade54f768e8d86a47eb70f7b29c334102f05fd489c58ae9c56f3183c2fb03f76
