msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Amédée taking the lead, we walked through the village, passing by crop fields and milk cows, "
"presumably shared among the villagers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫阿米迪带着我游览村子各处。⟪k:1⟫而在参观村里公用的水田、⟪k:2⟫奶牛时，我发现——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3BBA903D_63ED_4858_9BA6_6A82D861405F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 925e86b2a83e21f12babe3d33b02b51d2b3a01acd90d322eb2d5ea0ca36d06c7
#. default-sha256: 71c93cbd810e7167e268bf6dd773d808c01d1cdef616df82c6ce53d081a0cc37
