msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Houses were scattered across an area that seemed far too large for only a hundred people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对于只住着百余人的村庄来说过于宽广的土地上，⟪k:1⟫零散的民宅分布在土地各处。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BB3CF46_DC55_4CB5_99A0_966551048D3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a446ce2d413777fc88823f466870251e53a7b61d1c21abb58014f2ecef1b955
