msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5C2A7BB_E7EB_482E_A653_EC6EF6E0E3FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There weren’t hundreds, but ⟪k:1⟫thousands⟪k:2⟫ of people bustling about. Merchants from "
"afar came in droves."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫绝非眼前这个百人村庄的样子，⟪k:1⟫而是有数千人往来于此。⟪k:2⟫远方到来的商人也络绎不绝——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_71F229FB_7362_4221_9345_9FEAF100B178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ccaa8f9a98f602cfb95063f97714558a738f8edaddbe21a3f26aea71b3d68f2
