msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was much like how the capital is now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Actually, this area was more open to "
"foreigners."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫完全就是如今首都的景象。⟪k:1⟫不——比起首都，或许这里对异邦人更为开放吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_94A85F03_4F3D_42CC_94C6_F0FC1D1FA8EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
