msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what happens when a place is wiped from history.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I couldn’t tell you how "
"reliable the tablets are,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这是座被尘封在历史中的城镇。⟪k:1⟫虽然我不确定遗留下来的资料的可信程度，⟪k:2⟫但是——"

