msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People, crops, livestock, all dead.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maybe it was a natural disaster, a famine, a "
"plague—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can’t say for sure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不管是人、⟪k:1⟫农作物、⟪k:2⟫家畜。⟪k:3⟫全都死绝了。⟪k:4⟫到底是天灾、⟪k:5⟫饥荒、⟪k:6⟫或是瘟疫"
"——⟪k:7⟫真相不得而知。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_117F95DD_3C55_4F03_ABF0_59459188078A
