msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The deeper parts of the forest are so dense you can’t see anything but tree trunks and "
"leaves. It’s an eerie place, wrapped in a cloud of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫如果踏入深处，⟪k:1⟫视野会被茂密的树木所覆盖，那里是个令人不舒服的森林。⟪k:2⟫或者应该说……是葱"
"郁而阴暗的黑暗森林吧。"

