"bridge was built to mark the road leading to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫据说这座城镇的规模，⟪k:1⟫曾一度覆盖至那座馆。⟪k:2⟫河上的那座桥，⟪k:3⟫原本也是为了连接起通向那"
"座馆的道路吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_051B9A84_0600_41B1_95E8_D61DE028237E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
