msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With nowhere else to go, I ended up in this small village.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There was no "
"denying that there was very little to speak of here,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫已经无家可归的我，⟪k:2⟫好不容易才找到容身之处。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫虽然村子里确实什么都没有——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A19B5A9B_6DEE_40FC_AF38_4A0E1A518C20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e783f68f1cf3ddf7d1ebbce2f7021b3370654491657b9ae11ea0ee405028342e
