msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The village ran entirely on its own crops and livestock.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They had no currency, "
"merely bartered among themselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫村子似乎是靠农作来维持的。⟪k:1⟫这是个没有货币概念、⟪k:2⟫必要的物资都以物易物来交换的世界。"

